# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas build

Execute complete implementation from scratch or continue existing project.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-build [request]` or `/pure-saas build [request]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Inspect existing project framework, styling architecture, and backend contracts.
2. Bind all styling to semantic tokens in `DESIGN.md`. Reject hardcoded hex colors and arbitrary spacing numbers.
3. Build complete working product with real interaction states and logic—never stop at a mockup or hero scaffold.
4. Strictly preserve backend routes, database models, and authentication flows.
5. Verify desktop (1440px) and mobile (375px) layouts, run `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs check-tokens DESIGN.md --source src`, and report results.
